{"3417940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Chaos", "steam_appid": 3417940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Topple and spin through everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mug, book, and vase reacts with real physics. Bat them off the edge one by one, or spin through and clear the whole shelf at once. Every crash adds to the damage bill.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Star Shards and upgrade your Whirlwind Spin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms filled with hundreds of things to topple, and find the Star Shards hidden among the clutter. Spend them to spin bigger, spin longer, and recharge faster.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish the furniture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep collecting Star Shards and your cat grows stronger, until glass panels, chairs, tables, and entire shelves crumble under your spin. Then sit back and watch everything come crashing down.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/4cb20fabcd0977be01eb5db5b9881070.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/4cb20fabcd0977be01eb5db5b9881070.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/4cb20fabcd0977be01eb5db5b9881070.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and find hidden toy friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb anywhere a cat could reach, and plenty of places a cat shouldn't. Hidden toy friends are waiting in every level, from a cozy apartment to a whole supermarket.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/b0361fa1aeb9e24e5eb58ce5f1f02910.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/b0361fa1aeb9e24e5eb58ce5f1f02910.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/b0361fa1aeb9e24e5eb58ce5f1f02910.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a good nap and enjoy your human's reaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the chaos is done, curl up in your bed and drift off, then see how your human reacts to the aftermath. No timers, no fail states, no punishment. Just chaos.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/fd122d6d71d41fda289369e1f94cf5a7.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/fd122d6d71d41fda289369e1f94cf5a7.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/fd122d6d71d41fda289369e1f94cf5a7.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your favorite breed and toy friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as any of nine cat breeds, and bring along a toy friend you found while exploring. They ride on your back wherever the chaos takes you, so you're never causing trouble alone.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/612efa2546c6fb97cf2df3a60b491f61.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/612efa2546c6fb97cf2df3a60b491f61.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/612efa2546c6fb97cf2df3a60b491f61.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Topple and spin through everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mug, book, and vase reacts with real physics. Bat them off the edge one by one, or spin through and clear the whole shelf at once. Every crash adds to the damage bill.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/09080299dd76cdec1d5aedd9508254c5.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Star Shards and upgrade your Whirlwind Spin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms filled with hundreds of things to topple, and find the Star Shards hidden among the clutter. Spend them to spin bigger, spin longer, and recharge faster.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.webm?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/c6489ffbd04a83f3c8621bfff20ba7a0.mp4?t=1787476403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish the furniture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep collecting Star Shards and your cat grows stronger, until glass panels, chairs, tables, and entire shelves crumble under your spin. Then sit back and watch everything come crashing down.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/4cb20fabcd0977be01eb5db5b9881070.poster.avif?t=1787476403\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417940/extras/4cb20fabcd0977be01eb5db5b9881070.webm?t=17874764